title Ease off sharply from 90 rpm to 35 rpm without stopping (level 3)

# A rider easing off suddenly: the next PAS pulse arrives late. Predictive stop
# may briefly cut assist, but it must come straight back on the next pulse
# without waiting for the start delay again.
at 1000 cadence 90 over 500
at 4000 cadence 35 over 150
at 7000 cadence 0

end 8000

expect 3900 current > 0
expect 4300 current > 0
expect 5000 current > 0
expect 6900 current > 0
